silm:instances_papers_08_visual_discipline_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_1
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1" ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1Example" ;
    silm:hasExample "In '08ThesisConcreteAnchor1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the typed graph (G, R, tau) for the Mittens taxonomy diagram — nodes are Mittens, Felis catus, TSN 183798; arrows are classification-leg, taxonomy-leg, identity arrows." .

silm:instances_papers_08_visual_discipline_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_1%23typedgraphmittens
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1AddlBaseTopic" ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1AddlCircuitCorner" ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1AddlDunbarLayer" ;
    rdfs:label "08ThesisConcreteAnchor1AddlPaperKind" ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.08_visual_discipline.chapters.flat.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor_1#typedgraphmittens" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "base_topic:diagrammatic reasoning" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "circuit_corner:6" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "dunbar_layer:0" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "paper_kind:urn:silmaril:entity#papers.08_visual_discipline" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedGraphMittens is the typed graph (G, R, tau) for the Mittens taxonomy diagram — nodes are Mittens, Felis catus, TSN 183798; arrows are classification-leg, taxonomy-leg, identity arrows. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TGraph_8', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

